{
    "title": "Jackpocket Lottery App",
    "description": "Jackpocket is the safe and easy way to enjoy your favorite lottery games from home. Get NY, NJ, and NH lottery tickets for Powerball, Mega Millions, Cash4Life and more delivered right to your phone. Join over 2 million Jackpocket winners who have scored more than <b>$500 MILLION in lottery prizes to date!*</b> \ud83c\udf89\r\n\r\n<b>Pick Your Lucky Numbers</b>\r\nChoose your game & numbers (or get a Quick Pick), sit back, and relax. We\u2019ll secure your ticket from a licensed lottery retailer.\r\n\r\n<b>See Your Ticket</b>\r\nView a scan of your lottery ticket right in the app. You\u2019ll also receive an email with your ticket serial number. \r\n\r\n<b>Get Notified</b>\r\nReceive automatic winner alerts so you never miss out on a win.\r\n\r\n<b>Keep 100% of Your Winnings</b>\r\nCollect smaller prizes (usually up to $600) right to your Jackpocket account. For BIG wins, we transfer your paper ticket to you so you can claim your prize from the state lottery. \r\n\r\n<b>Giveaways Galore</b>\r\nEnter exclusive Giveaways right in the app for chances to win vacations, sports tickets, and other prizes from our amazing partners.\r\n\r\n<b>Official Lottery Courier</b>\r\nJackpocket is the first officially registered lottery courier in New York and New Jersey. You must be physically located in New York, New Jersey, or New Hampshire to place a ticket order.\r\n\r\n<b>What Else Can Jackpocket Do?</b>\r\nAutomatically order tickets for your favorite drawings, check lottery results, track jackpots nationwide, find a lottery retailer near you, and access responsible lottery tools and resources. \r\n\r\nQuestions, suggestions? Email us at support@jackpocket.com or visit support.jackpocket.com to learn more.  \r\n\r\nJackpocket is committed to creating a safe, secure and responsible lottery experience. If you or someone you know has a gambling problem and wants help, contact the National Council on Problem Gambling at 1-800-GAMBLER or visit https://ncpgambling.org/. Residents of NY call 1-877-8-HOPE-NY or text HOPENY (467369).\r\n\r\nMust be 18 or older and within state boundaries to order a ticket. 21+ in Arizona. 19+ in Nebraska. Jackpocket is not affiliated with any State Lottery. Please visit jackpocket.com/tos for full terms of service.\r\n\r\n*Based on the total dollar amount of lottery prizes won by Jackpocket customers as of 6/25/24",
    "descriptionHTML": "Jackpocket is the safe and easy way to enjoy your favorite lottery games from home. Get NY, NJ, and NH lottery tickets for Powerball, Mega Millions, Cash4Life and more delivered right to your phone. Join over 2 million Jackpocket winners who have scored more than <b>$500 MILLION in lottery prizes to date!*</b> \ud83c\udf89<br><br><b>Pick Your Lucky Numbers</b><br>Choose your game &amp; numbers (or get a Quick Pick), sit back, and relax. We\u2019ll secure your ticket from a licensed lottery retailer.<br><br><b>See Your Ticket</b><br>View a scan of your lottery ticket right in the app. You\u2019ll also receive an email with your ticket serial number. <br><br><b>Get Notified</b><br>Receive automatic winner alerts so you never miss out on a win.<br><br><b>Keep 100% of Your Winnings</b><br>Collect smaller prizes (usually up to $600) right to your Jackpocket account. For BIG wins, we transfer your paper ticket to you so you can claim your prize from the state lottery. <br><br><b>Giveaways Galore</b><br>Enter exclusive Giveaways right in the app for chances to win vacations, sports tickets, and other prizes from our amazing partners.<br><br><b>Official Lottery Courier</b><br>Jackpocket is the first officially registered lottery courier in New York and New Jersey. You must be physically located in New York, New Jersey, or New Hampshire to place a ticket order.<br><br><b>What Else Can Jackpocket Do?</b><br>Automatically order tickets for your favorite drawings, check lottery results, track jackpots nationwide, find a lottery retailer near you, and access responsible lottery tools and resources. <br><br>Questions, suggestions? Email us at support@jackpocket.com or visit support.jackpocket.com to learn more.  <br><br>Jackpocket is committed to creating a safe, secure and responsible lottery experience. If you or someone you know has a gambling problem and wants help, contact the National Council on Problem Gambling at 1-800-GAMBLER or visit https://ncpgambling.org/. Residents of NY call 1-877-8-HOPE-NY or text HOPENY (467369).<br><br>Must be 18 or older and within state boundaries to order a ticket. 21+ in Arizona. 19+ in Nebraska. Jackpocket is not affiliated with any State Lottery. Please visit jackpocket.com/tos for full terms of service.<br><br>*Based on the total dollar amount of lottery prizes won by Jackpocket customers as of 6/25/24",
